window.products.push({"id":429027,"name":"Hyoola Candle Drip Protectors Reusable Metal Candlestick Liners - Safety Pin Holds Candles in Place - Silver - 2 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aCCRg82wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SAFE, PRACTICAL & ELEGANT Bask in warm candlelight without leaving behind a mess of melted wax. These Reusable Metal Candle Holders by Hyoola feature a pointy pin at the center that pierces your wax candle to hold it upright. As your tapers stand sturdy and straight, the flame burns cleanly, leaving behind little, if any, wax residue to clean after use. Any residual wax is caught by these drip guards, protecting your precious crystal, silver or gold candlesticks. While protecting your beloved candelabras from wax, these Reusable Metal Candle Holders also blend in beautifully. A step above disposable aluminum foil drip catchers, these nickel-plated drip guards feature a smooth, shiny surface with a rimmed lip in an elegant silver tone that complements your decor. Hyoola’s Reusable Metal Candle Holders fit most standard-sized candle holders and accommodate candles of varying widths, from slim tapers to wider tall candles. Simply push your candle into the sharp pin to secure. PRODUCT FEATURES: Reusable Metal Candle Holders Safety Pin Secures Candles in Place Nickel-plated 2 x 2 x 1” Shiny Silver Finish 2 Pack One Size Fits Most MULTIPURPOSE PROTECTION Whichever type of candle you kindle, these Reusable Metal Candle Holders by Hyoola saved you time and energy while making cleanup a breeze! Use them for religious, celebratory, outdoor, or emergency purposes alike: - Weddings and Celebrations- Church & Baptism Ceremonies- Candlelight Vigils- Advent Wreath- Legion of Mary Meetings- Chandeliers & Candelabras- Chanuka Menorah- Kwanzaa Candles- Decorative Centerpiece for all Occasions- Hold Emergency Candles in Power Outage- Restaurants & Cafes- Spas & Yoga Studios- Outdoor Camping Trips Try these Reusable Candle Holders today and let Hyoola light up your life!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aCCRg82wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hyoola","source_asin":"B085P3XR49","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-429027","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085P3XR49","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085P3XR49","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
