window.products.push({"id":429084,"name":"OG Kush Scented Candle ( Medium ) - Spicy Patchouli, Lemongrass, Orange and Pine - Natural Ingredients - Long Lasting - Revitalizing Aroma - Hemp Wick","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YgMQY1s5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Spice up your home with this 100% natural scented candle. The fragrance is a subtle blend of spicy patchouli, lemongrass, orange oil and pine oil and is a surefire way to make a house feel like a home. This is far more efficient – and pleasant – than artificial air fresheners which can only offer short-range, short-term effects. In fact, there are zero artificial or harmful chemicals in this candle. The double wick means it’s extra clean-burning and is far less likely to leave any sooty residues behind than cheaper scented candles. You can expect to get up to forty hours of burning time from this candle which means it’s just as useful in a power cut as it is for giving you a wonderful-smelling home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YgMQY1s5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Scent Galaxy","source_asin":"B076PMMFND","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-429084","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076PMMFND","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076PMMFND","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":429085,"name":"Tangkula 30 Inch Round Wall Clock, Farmhouse Large Wall Clock with Roman Numerals, Decorative Wooden Wall Clock, Come with AA Battery, Rustic Wall Clo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TASlKAyXL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"⏰【Solid Wood & Metal for Durability】 Made of 100% solid fir, the dial of our wall clock is sturdy enough to have a long service time. Our wall clock won't crack easily because of the thick fir and the thickness of the dial is 1\". The whole round metal frame and pointers are bronze which add sense of utility to the wall clock. ⏰【Large Roman Numerals】The Numbers on the wall clock are specially designed. Roman numerals are selected to instead of the ordinary Arabic numerals. The large size of numbers can be showed clearly even when you stand in the distance. The color contrast between the Numbers and the dial makes the numbers easy to read. ⏰【Battery Operated】Our wall clock has a battery holder at back and it works with one AA Carbon battery (not included). ⏰【Antique & Classical Style】Original & natural fir provides classic feeling to the clock. And bronzed metal Roman numerals and frame provide an archaic feeling. Combining with these two feelings, our wall clock is designed in retro and rustic style. This old-fashioned clock is suitable for living room, office, restaurant, coffee bar and anywhere you prefer. ⏰【Open Faced & Easy Assembly】Our wall clock has no glass surface so you can clearly read the time from all angles without any reflection. What’s more, the installation process is simple for you and you just need to select a best position and then hang the clock on the wall with solid nails.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TASlKAyXL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tangkula","source_asin":"B07VRQCGMJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-429085","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VRQCGMJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VRQCGMJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
