window.products.push({"id":429140,"name":"12.5In Fish Spatula, HaSteeL Stainless Steel Slotted Turner with Plastic Handle, Heavy Duty Metal Griddle Spatula for Grilling Cooking Baking Flipping","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iHCxK+WAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you still looking for some durable metal spatulas? HaSteel fish spatulas are made of high quality stainless steel and plastic handle, which enhances its service life. Using food grade material so you don't have to worry about any toxic substances or harmful coatings. Matte finish blade makes cleaning a breeze and dishwasher friendly. Are you still bothered that your old one is difficult to use? Our slotted turners are very ergonomically designed to minimize hand fatigue even during long cooking process. Heat resistant handle without any burrs or rough spots ensures safe and comfortable to hold. With beveled edge is ideal for cooking, frying, baking, flipping and grilling. Large end hole with 2 free hooks for easy hanging in your kitchen or outdoor grill griddles. Are you still having trouble figuring out what to get for the holidays? These metal spatulas works great on most of cookware, like frying pan, grills, griddles, teppanyaki, flat top, cast iron skillet and more. It’s a wonderful gift for dad, husband, boyfriend, friends, neighbors or anyone who enjoy cooking frequently. Product specification: Material: pure stainless steel blade & PP plastic handle Dimension: total L 12.5in x W 3.2in What you get: 2 x fish spatulas + 2 x S hanging hooks Tips for maintenance & using: 1- Please use mild detergent to thoroughly clean those residua left from manufacturing before first for healthy cooking.  2- Please clean it as soon as possible before and after each use, and dry it with soft rag instead of air dry to avoid water stains.  3- Please don’t use sharp object to wipe it to avoid metal scratches, and store them in dry place for its durability. Thank you for shopping with HaSteeL! Hope you enjoy you cooking with our products! If you have any concerns just feel free to contact us!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iHCxK+WAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HaSteeL","source_asin":"B0BTBR5W72","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-429140","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTBR5W72","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTBR5W72","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
