window.products.push({"id":429281,"name":"ANCTOR Full Size Bed Frame, Upholstered Platform Bed with Adjustable Headboard,Heavy Duty Steel Support Legs, Mattress Foundation, Easy Assembly,Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eiip0Y37L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stable & Durable -- ANCTOR bed frame is supported by high quality steel and solid wood slats. 9 heavy-duty steel support legs and dense 12 wood slats support a maximum weight of 1000 lbs (Full 900 lbs); ensures no shaking and no noise disturbance when moving. Easy to assemble -- the bed slats are secured with Velcro and each part is marked with numbers corresponding to the instructions, you just need to match these numbers and one person can easily complete the installation. Stable & Durable -- ANCTOR bed frame is supported by high quality steel and solid wood slats. 9 heavy-duty steel support legs and dense 12 wood slats support a maximum weight of 1000 lbs (Full 900 lbs); ensures no shaking and no noise disturbance when moving. Comfortable -- The headboard is made of linen fabric and filled with thick foam inside, providing a soft and comfortable touch; leaning on it, you can feel the instant bounce. No Box Spring Required-- Consisting of wooden slats can help you eliminate the need for box spring. Each wooden slat is spaced 2.8\" apart, allowing air circulation and extending the life of the mattress Hassle-free Service -- All parts and tools are packed in a box and delivered to your doorstep.24/7 customer service is standing by.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eiip0Y37L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ANCTOR","source_asin":"B0B967649K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-429281","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B967649K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B967649K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":429282,"name":"ARTLEO Small Ice Cube Trays for Freezer with Lid, Perfect 55 Mini Nugget Ice Trays with Cover, Easy Release 2 Trays Making 110 Cute Cubes, Cocktail Te","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718YJWTgg4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easy Release Ice Cube Tray: Made of highly-elastic plastic with smooth surface, Flexible and Durable. Ice cubes release easily with just a twist, No need to wait for the ice cubes to melt a bit, no need to tap the bottom or run water! You can empty the tray immediately after take it out from the freezer. Silicone ice cube molds & trays can not pour all cubes at a time. Easy to Use Ice Cube Trays: The heightened edge prevent spills, easier to fill, easier to transport than the too soft silicone ice trays. There are uniform protrusions between each cube compartment, keep the ice cubes in the perfect nugget shape instead of sticking together, easy to remove, of course please don't overfill. Stackable Ice Trays with Lid：Just like the picture, the lid is designed to fit more closely to the tray, Keeps ice fresh and sanitary by preventing ice from absorbing freezer odors. Also allows for stacking multiple trays, save a lot of space. The stacked size is 10.6(L) x 6.7(W) x 3(H) inches, fits nicely in RV freezer and Home Fridges. Strong & Safety: Made of food-grade material, Bpa-free, no smell, no greasy film floating, safe for your family! ARTLEO 55 mini ice cube trays use better materials and designs to make them stronger and more durable. Thick and Elastic! They can withstand long-term low-temperature storage without breaking! Start to use them to enjoy ice drinks time! Wide Application: Each large tray makes 55 mini nugget ice cubes for a total of 110 (Each capacity of 6 ml, each tray of 325ml). Mini ice cubes are widely used in life, perfect for Cocktail, Coffee and Tea, baby food, perfect to use for a protein shake and smoothie, and perfect for those who do chew ice. A must-have tool for home parties, RV travel! Better Service: If the ice cube trays cracked, please contact us and be willing to provide a better solution for every customer! All your questions will be replied to within 24hrs!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718YJWTgg4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARTLEO","source_asin":"B09CDYVWP5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-429282","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CDYVWP5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CDYVWP5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
