window.products.push({"id":429415,"name":"Csonka Fully Accesorized SmoKit, Classic Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ctzF0DVxL.jpg","description":"What Csonka has done for the standard sized cigar market, we've accomplished for the smaller sized cigarillos. The great news is that it also is perfect for cigarettes as well. There's no doubt that the Csonka SmoKit is the coolest tobacco travel case yet, equipped with an array of unique silver accessories. Featured inside is Csonka's all new, very classy stainless steel portable ashtray . . . that's the exact size as our premium cigar cutter. Also inside is a high quality quartz clock, storage for a host of standard lighters, a humidification regulator, and retainer bars to keep your cigarillos and cigarettes safe and in place. The accessory set, which includes the travel ashtray, quartz clock and pipette with tip may be purchased separately because many may wish to use these items in their other Csonka portable travel humidors due to its modular design. Note that the Csonka SmoKit is the first-ever humidified case for cigarettes and cigarillos. Smokers will tell you, given their choice, they would prefer to smoke tobacco that has been properly humidity regulated. It's size is a compact 3.8î x 4.8î x 1î, yet will easily hold 15 or more sticks. It's available in four great colors, including: classic black, saddle tan, wine burgundy, and all new pewter gray. We're proud that it's made in the USA, and like all other Csonka products, we 100% guarantee customer satisfaction. All cases exclude any cigars that may be shown in picture(s).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ctzF0DVxL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Csonka Worldwide","source_asin":"B0001IDJYA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-429415","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0001IDJYA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0001IDJYA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
