window.products.push({"id":429490,"name":"Nagina International Shipwrecked Artificially Rustic Vintage Ship's Porthole Mirrors | Pirate's Exclusive Nautical Wall Decor & Gifts (17 Inches, Anti","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wTI6OQiJL._AC_SL1296_.jpg","description":"Exclusive Yet Functional Decorative Premium Nautical Porthole. Express Your Love For Nautical Through These Beautifully Cast Antique Rustic Vintage Wall Portholes. A Must Have For Nautically Themed Rooms And Halls, This Is A Classic Addition To Your Homes Walls & Corners. Artificially Antiqued To Match A Realistic Wrecked Ship, The Nautically Inspired Premium Porthole. It Will Surely Add-Up Compliments To The Nautical-Themed Rooms And Walls. A Porthole, Sometimes Called Bull's-Eye, Is A Generally Circular Porthole Frame Used On The Hull Of Ships To Stream & Admit Light And Air. Though The Term Is Of Maritime Origin, It Is Also Used To Describe Round Portholes On Armored Vehicles, Aircraft, Automobiles And Even Spacecraft. On A Ship, The Function Of A Porthole, When Open, Is To Permit Light And Fresh Air To Enter The Dark And Often Damp Below-Deck Quarters Of The Vessel. It Also Used To Affords Below-Deck Occupants A Limited, But Often Much Needed View To The Outside World. Enlighten Your Wall And Bathrooms With Our Wonderful Finishing Portholes, With The Appealing Finish That Provides A Good With Enough Reason To Have One. Cast & Moulded Out Of Solid Grade Metal, Nautical Portholes Are Truly An Amazing Addition If You Are A Pirate's Admirer. Not Only For Aficionados. Nautical Porthole Could Be Used At Various Places, From Your Beaches Houses To Offices, Bathrooms To Basins. An Ageless Solid Grade Metal Porthole Frame That Will Survive Ages When Treated Accordingly. The Finish On The Porthole Is Sealed And Won't Fade Or Go Away Over The Years Of Exposure. All Portholes Sold By Us Are Actually Openable Portholes With Actual Hinge And Wing Nuts That Keep The Movement Locking. The Wings Are Threaded On The Metal Studs And Winds Down Easily To For Allowing Access Inside And Then For Closure Later. Place This Item In Your Lake House, Bar, Or Any Other Nautical Themed Room You Can Imagine. This Mediterranean-Style Wall Mounting Decor Ornament Is Perfect Choice For Living Room, Home Or Shop, Office, Pirate Themes Room, Seaside Gardens, Patio, Tiki-Bar, Floating Tiki, Nature Adventurous Wild Camps, Vans etc. Possibilities Are Endless & Limitless. Keep Exploring Nagina International For More Such Impressive Wall Decors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wTI6OQiJL._AC_SL1296_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nagina International","source_asin":"B0723FS219","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-429490","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0723FS219","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0723FS219","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
