window.products.push({"id":429592,"name":"oridom Mini Oven Mitts with Non-Slip Grip Surfaces and Hanging Loop,Heat Resistant 446°F Gloves Potholder with Cotton Lining for Handling Hot Pot Cook","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tv0orwQYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When you invest in a sturdy chef’s knife, cooking immediately becomes easier, safer, and more satisfying.The same thing is true of a good pair of oven mitts. You don’t need to worry about burning your hand on a hot skillet handle or dropping a stockpot full of boiling water halfway between the stovetop and kitchen sink. GET A BETTER GRIP: Experience the best oven mitts you will own with the Grip Set of 2 Oven Mitts! Constructed of durable silicone and cotton, the mitts are oven gloves, helping you to get the best grip while you cook! The unique textured pattern of the silicone helps you hold tight to pans, pots and baking sheets without hindering your natural grip. That’s because our silicone is the most flexible and will mold to your hand, making them perfect for baking, BBQ’ing, carving, and more! HEAT RESISTANT AND WATERPROOF: Feel confident knowing that your hands and arms will be protected. Our mitts offer you maximum protection from high temperatures of up to 446’ Fahrenheit, more than others on the market. Our silicone is waterproof, so hot liquids won’t soak through and scald your skin as they would with other materials. Plus, you can easily clean them simply by rinsing under water with soap! COMFORTABLE PADDED LINING: Stay comfortable while you cook! The 100% cotton lining and 100% polyester fill of the mitts offer additional protection and comfort, and feel simply amazing. One cotton loop is also included in each mitt to make for easy hanging when the mitts are not in use. They have a good combo of silicone and cotton, so they're easy to maneuver while still being great for grabbing hot items, like steamy dinner casseroles. The terry cloth lining makes them comfy to wear and even more heat resistant.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tv0orwQYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"oridom","source_asin":"B08SQ7VVVV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-429592","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SQ7VVVV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SQ7VVVV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
