window.products.push({"id":429632,"name":"Goodful All-in-One Pan, Multilayer Nonstick, High-Performance Cast Construction, Multipurpose Design Replaces Multiple Pots and Pans, Dishwasher Safe ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tVejJfUIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Say hello to the last pan you'll ever need! The Goodful 11-inch All-In-One sauté pan, or chef's pan, can replace a variety of different types of cookware. The multi-functional pan can be used as a frying pan, sauté pan, saucepan, stockpot, wok pan, skillet, and braiser. Includes matching lid, and beechwood turner. The 4.4-quart deep-dish design easily makes one-pan meals, sauces, entrees, and sides. No matter what you’re cooking, this pan is always up for the task. So, pan fry, sauté, sear, boil, simmer, blanche, braise, poach, deep fry, stew and then serve in style. The anti-warp cast aluminum construction is heavy-duty, allowing it to last for years of cooking service. Even though this pot is heavy-duty, it's light enough to easily maneuver around your kitchen. It is much lighter than a cast iron skillet, cast iron dutch oven, or cast-iron griddle. The ergonomic, soft-touch handle and helper handle allow you to move this way or that with ease. Provides evenly distributed heat which improves cooking quality. Compatible with all cooktops: electric, gas, glass, or induction cooktop. The durable, high-performance, long-lasting, multilayer non-stick coating allows food to easily slide out of the pan. Also, pans are manufactured without PFOA, lead, cadmium, toxic metals, or nanoparticles. So long elbow grease, wrinkled fingers, and rigorous scrubbing due to tough, stuck-on food, the pan and matching lid are dishwasher safe. We do suggest hand washing the beechwood turner which keeps it in tip-top shape.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tVejJfUIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Goodful","source_asin":"B0BNP9KNZ7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-429632","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNP9KNZ7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNP9KNZ7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
