window.products.push({"id":429697,"name":"RTOGM 3-Pack Shower Caddy Shelf, Adhesive Shower Shelves No Drilling, Bathroom Shower Organizer, Rustproof Storage Racks for Inside Shower Wall, Shamp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8120UFTQIuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The package includes 2 x 8-hook shower shelves, 1 x 4-hook soap holder and 4 x adhesives (3 necessary & 1 replacement). The latest multi-functional shower racks has enough capacity to hold large bottles of shampoo, perfectly storing and organizing all your daily shower supplies, which can make your space cleaner & tidier. Upgraded larger adhesive is highly sticky and features 3 slots that won't break for increased load-bearing capacity and stability. These shower shelves have been tested and proven to hold at least 30 lbs, enough to carry all your shower items without the worry of damage from the shelf falling off the wall after installation. Easy to install & use, no drilling or tools required, no damage to your walls and no marks on the walls after removal. RTOGM's shower organizer feature a thickened design that is sturdy against deformation. Unlike others, our shelves will not start to pull down or sliding forward even if they are fully filled with heavy items, and the stronger load-bearing structure ensures that they are always level and vertical to the wall. In addition, they have longer, wider & higher fences, which both increase capacity and prevent bottles from falling. The shower holder is truly made of thickened stainless steel, the outer layer is painted and then baked for secondary protection, featuring water-proof, moisture-proof and rust-proof. The bottom is newly covered with a layer of grid in addition to the support line, which can quickly drain to keep the items dry and clean, and you can also put some small items on it, such as necklaces/rings, etc. These versatile shelves are suitable for smooth and flat walls such as tile, marble, metal, wood, tempered and frosted glass, etc. They can be installed on straight walls or corners in bathrooms, showers, kitchens, bedrooms, living rooms, balconies and other places, which is helpful for space organization and utilization.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8120UFTQIuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RTOGM","source_asin":"B0BD52JVP2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-429697","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BD52JVP2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BD52JVP2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
