window.products.push({"id":429842,"name":"Custom Canvas Wall Art Multi Photo Collage Personalized Prints with Your Picture Name for Pets or Family Customized Canvas Poster Framed for Living Ro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-UhkyKBDL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Features: 1.Personalized Canvas Prints: Choose the size and template you like, and upload your picture. We will customize canvas prints based on your photos. Enhance the look and feel of your decor with this Styletify custom canvas pictures wall art.Customized personalized collage picture can save a special moment on exquisite canvas, such as wedding kisses, beautiful journey scenery, lively children and graduation smiles, etc. It will be a unique artwork.2. Premium Canvas Poster: Fine workmanship and materials are the guarantee of quality. This Styletify photo prints is digitally printed on canvas using a high quality printing process that use archive ink, bright and colorful, environmentally friendly, waterproof, anti-ultraviolet, and never fade!The picture canvas/customized gift is stretched over a sturdy wooden frame for lasting durability.3.Ready to Hang: There is a metal hook on the back of our personalized photos, which can be easy and convenient to mount at anytime. Exquisite digital canvas prints can be mounted in the lounge, bedroom, bathroom,lobby, kitchen, or office and will add a warm aesthetic and become the focal point of attention.4.Personalized Gift: A special personalized gift is a good choice for your wife, husband, parents, grandparents, partner, friends or girlfriends, especially suitable for important occasions such as weddings, Thanksgiving, Christmas, Father's Day, Valentine's Day, birthday decorations, etc.Note: Click the \"Customize Now\" button to add image to the specified box. When uploading the photo, please make sure that the photo covers the entire canvas area, and select the template size that match photo. Please upload the picture in the \"JPEG\" file format. The HD picture must be at least 75 DPI. The digital camera resolution must be at least 4 megapixels. (P.S. Do not use mobile phone screenshots because they are of lower quality, and low-resolution pictures will be low-quality prints.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-UhkyKBDL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Styletify","source_asin":"B0C1Z2RVY1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-429842","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1Z2RVY1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1Z2RVY1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
