window.products.push({"id":429844,"name":"DORBOKER Real Moving Gears Wall Clock Large Modern Metal Clocks for Living Room Decor, Industrial Steampunk Unique Vintage Rustic Decorative Clock for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81krSlvjC-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧭【Large Wall Clock with Unique Design】This modern wall clock is very big, almost 30 inch, large cut out skeleton style, metal Roman Numerals with aluminium dial and plating brushed copper gold finished, wheels in various different sizes are really turning in the central, clear HD tempered glass lens protects the clock face from dust, and keep it safe and away from broken, It's so COOL. 🧭【Exquisite Real Moving Gears】Industrial steampunk style wall clock, brush grey silver metal skeleton with vintage gears in the central. When you put batteries in, various exposed steampunk cogs start rotating. The slight almost silent gears turning gives a quiet and peaceful feeling, definitely an eye-catching wall décor for your home or office. 🧭【Aesthetics Art Decor for Your Room】The beautiful gears clock in diameter 28 inch, depth 3.3 inch(70*8.5cm), perfect combination of modern Contemporary & industrial steampunk style, Fits most decor whether french country, rustic farmhouse, vintage traditional classic, shabby chic, Elegant Mid-century; Suitable for kitchen, dining, living room, fireplace, foyer, hallway, entry hallway,bar, restaurant, coffee house, office, studio, garage,covered outdoor garden and more! 🧭【Accurate Time and Easy to Read】The large industrial wall clock is using high quality quartz movement to run smoothly, ensuring accurate timing and absolute silence, no annoying ticking. Rustic clock has Big Dial with large Roman numerals under HD clear toughened glass cover, easy to read from any angle. 🧭【Battery Operated, Easy to Use】 This steampunk cog wall clock arrives fully assembled, requires 1 AA battery for clock operation; 2 additional AA batteries for mechanical gears turning, Gears move independently of hands ,battery not included; Keyhole for hanging is in the back included for easy to install. 🧭【Our Promise to You 】 We are confident in the quality of our large moving gears clocks, DORBOKER provides FULL REFUND/REPLACEMENT GUARANTEE. If there are any issue about our gears wall clock, please feel free to contact us anytime, we will reply to you in 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81krSlvjC-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DORBOKER","source_asin":"B0BCKGBYYP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-429844","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCKGBYYP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCKGBYYP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
