window.products.push({"id":429997,"name":"TOSSOW Ceramic Tea mug with Infuser and Lid 14oz Steeping Tea Cups Single Cup Loose Tea Brewing System Teaware with Filter（Black）","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714OpUUXwnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For Tea Lovers - If you are a fan of tea, then, probably, the drink from the sachets will not satisfy you. Do you want to enjoy the most delicious and flavorous freshly brewed tea at home or at work? Use our tea cup with lid to brew a large portion of the drink per person (capacity - 13.5oz / 400ml). Excellent Functionality - TOSSOW tea cup with lid is made of high-fired ceramic, which allows it be heat-resistant up to 120C / 240F. Removable infuser is made of stainless steel, so it is durable and wear-resistant. You can wash the tea infuser mug in the dishwasher. The Simplest Usage - Fill the tea leaves into a mesh of our tea mug with infuser, put the mesh into a cup and pour the water of the necessary temperature (depending on the sort of tea), close the big tea cup with a lid and let the tea brew. Then open the lid and pull out the infuser with the leaves. Premium Materials & Certified Safe - Tea Mug are made of high quality Porcelain (FDA Safe, Lead & Cadmium Free), Chip & Stain Resistant, more sturdy than stoneware, Infuser made of High Quality SUS304 Stainless Steel (FDA Safe) - Food & Medical Level, Totally Non-toxic, Non-Rust. Comfortable and Anti-Hot Handle - The handle design is comfortable to grip and never gets hot. You can easily hold a cup of tea and enjoy it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714OpUUXwnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"T TOSSOW","source_asin":"B07VL8BMXD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-429997","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VL8BMXD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VL8BMXD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
